                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>基于探究 聚焦概念的高中生物教学设计<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>——以“光合作用过程”一节探究教学设计为例<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">摘要</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">在“光合作用过程”一节教学中，通过创设真实生物学情境，引导学生发现问题，解决问题；通过光合作用发现的科学史资料的探究分析，帮助学生构建光合作用概念模型，进一步发展科学探究、科学思维、社会责任等生物学学科核心素养。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">关键词 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">真实情境<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>科学史<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN>光合作用<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN>核心素养　<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">设计思想<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>《普通高中生物学课程标准（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017</SPAN>年版）》对核心素养的达成提供了以 “聚焦概念”为特点的课程内容安排，要求教师围绕这些大概念组织并开展教学活动，帮助学生强化对知识的理解和迁移。教学中一方面需要教师向学生提供有助于概念建构的生物学事实，另一方面也需要教师运用包括探究教学在内的多种教学策略和方法开展概念教学<SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>[1]</SPAN></SUP>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">教学分析<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>光合作用在生物界乃至整个自然界物质和能量转换中具有重要的地位和作用，是高中生物学教学的重要内容，前呈“<SPAN lang=EN-US>ATP</SPAN>与<SPAN lang=EN-US>ADP</SPAN>之间的相互转化伴随着能量转化”，后接“细胞呼吸将储存在有机物分子中的能量转化为生命活动可以利用的能量”，并与当今粮食、环境等热点问题密切相关。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>细胞的生存需要能量和营养物质。通过分析叶绿体结构和成分，开展提取和分离叶绿体色素，分析这些色素的吸收光谱和作用光谱，从而理解叶绿体的结构和成分是光合作用过程的物质基础。光合作用的实质是无机物转变成有机物的过程中伴随着能量的转化，是绝大多数生物能量和营养物质的根本来源。结合光合作用的原理并依据相关的研究结果，能帮助学生进一步理解影响光合速率的内外因素及其在生产实践中的应用。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>初中阶段学生已学习了光合作用的发现史，“海尔蒙特设计柳树浇水实验，指出水是光合作用的原料；普利斯特利设计密闭玻璃罩内植物和小鼠生存实验，证明植物可以更新空气；英格豪斯将带叶的枝条放到水里，发现光照下才能产生氧气；萨克斯利用半叶法，证明叶片在光下能够产生淀粉；恩吉尔曼利用水绵进行试验，指出光合作用场所是叶绿体”帮助学生初步建构了光合作用的总反应。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">光合作用的光反应和碳反应过程的发现凝聚了众多科学家的努力，结合真实情境合理利用这些科学史文本素材进行二手资料探究，能够</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">引导学生感受到知识产生与发展是受当时科学发展水平限制的，帮助学生体悟到科学上的每一项发明和发现的背后，都蕴含着科学家科学的探究过程</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">，从而有效培养学生科学探究、科学思维等核心素养<SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>[2]</SPAN></SUP>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">教学目标<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）通过对光合作用光反应和碳反应科学史资料中实验结论的分析，阐明光合作用的过程，树立结构与功能观、物质与能量观等生命观念。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）通</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">过学习光合作用发现过程的几个经典实验，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">学生能较清晰地分析归纳出材料的重点，能有条理地表达自己的观点；</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">通过小组合作学习，能熟练地进行相关内容的图文转化，并尝试用准确的生物学术语</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">解释光合作用的过程。发展归纳与概括，演绎与推理，批判性思维等科学思维。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）通过小组合作分析科学家的探究过程，领悟科学探究的过程和方法，提升提出问题、分析问题和解决问题等科学探究能力。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">通过对光合作用过程中光反应、碳反应相互关系的分析和讨论，逐渐形成</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">事物是普遍联系</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">的辩证唯物主义世界观，并将其应运于解决农业生产相关的现实问题。</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">课堂教学过程</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.1 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">设置情境，问题导入</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">教师取两个</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1.5L</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">的农夫山泉塑料空瓶，加入等量的清水，分别加入两株长势相近的绿萝。一组正常光照，一组用黑布遮盖，在相同且适宜的环境下培养五天。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">在课堂上，教师呈现实验情境，并说明实验方案的设计思路。提问：请你预测黑布遮盖组的绿萝生长情况？</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>学生根据初中所学的光合作用知识和生活经验预测：绿萝变黄或腐烂。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>教师揭开黑布，结果两个装置中的绿萝长势基本一样，没有出现变黄腐烂现象，与学生预测不符合，使得学生陷入思考。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">光照是光合作用的必要条件，而现在我们观察到的现象是：两组绿萝的生长没有差别。我们观察不到有什么不同，是否表明这两组绿萝的生理状态确实没有差异？如何分析？</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">学生思考、讨论相关问题。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">教师：要分析其原因，需要从微观的植物生理变化角度着手。接下来，我们通过学习科学家罗伯特希尔、鲁宾和卡门、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>San Pietro</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">、布莱克曼和</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">瓦伯格</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">、阿农、卡尔文等人对光合作用过程的一系列探究实验，来建构光合作用的微观过程。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>设计意图：通过真实的情境设置认知冲突，激发学生的学习兴趣，提出想探究的问题，从而使学生全身心投入课堂探究学习中。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4.2 </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">概念回顾，提出问题</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>请<SPAN lang=EN-US>A</SPAN>同学表述光合作用过程，并用手机录音软件实时记录。如有不足请其它同学补充，提炼出光合作用条件，场所，反应物，产物等总反应式的相关信息。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>请<SPAN lang=EN-US>B</SPAN>同学板书光合作用的总反应式。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT size=3>教师分析总反应式，提出如下问题：光合作用产生的氧气中的氧元素来自哪里？氧气的产生和葡萄糖的形成是同一过程吗？<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>设计意图：学生在初中已学习了光合作用相关知识，通过学生表述和书写反应式来检测学生对这一概念的前概念知识；经过这节课学习之后，可以与新形成的概念进行比较、辨析，从而评价课堂学习效果。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">4.3 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">分析史料，构建模型<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">4.3.1 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">分析科学史，构建光反应概念模型<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>在讨论开始之前，要求<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>个同学为一组，推选一名同学为组长，一名同学为小组发言人。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">教师提供如下科学史资料：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">希尔反应<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>希尔从叶片中分离出叶绿体，然后在加入希尔氧化剂如<SPAN lang=EN-US>2,6</SPAN>－<SPAN lang=EN-US>D [</SPAN>一种染料，氧化态<SPAN lang=EN-US>(A)</SPAN>时为蓝色还原态<SPAN lang=EN-US>(AH<SUB>2</SUB>)</SPAN>为无色<SPAN lang=EN-US>]</SPAN>。在无<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>存在下进行照光，发现<SPAN lang=EN-US>2,6</SPAN>－<SPAN lang=EN-US>D</SPAN>由蓝色变为无色，并有气体产生。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）鲁宾和卡门的实验<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1941</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年，鲁宾和卡门制备了含有少量同位素<SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>18</SPAN></SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>O</SPAN>的碳酸氢盐和水，并用以供给照射的小球藻培养物。然后分析产生的氧，三次实验的结果如图<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><?xml:namespace prefix = "v" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 stroked="f" filled="f" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" o:preferrelative="t" o:spt="75" coordsize="21600,21600"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:connecttype="rect" gradientshapeok="t" o:extrusionok="f"></v:path><o:lock aspectratio="t" v:ext="edit"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape id=图片_x0020_1 style="HEIGHT: 197.25pt; WIDTH: 372.75pt; mso-position-horizontal-relative: page; mso-position-vertical-relative: page" type="#_x0000_t75" o:spid="_x0000_i1025"><v:imagedata o:title="" src="file:///C:/Users/dlian112/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png"></v:imagedata></v:shape><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>                       </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">图<SPAN lang=EN-US>1 </SPAN>鲁宾和卡门实验的结果<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US>San Pietro</SPAN>的实验<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>20</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">世纪<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>年代中，<SPAN lang=EN-US>San Pietro </SPAN>等证明叶绿体光下进行希尔反应可还原辅酶‖<SPAN lang=EN-US> (NADP<SUP>+</SUP>)</SPAN>，形成还原性辅酶‖（<SPAN lang=EN-US>NADPH</SPAN>），肯定了它是光合作用重要的能量转换反应产物。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）布莱克曼、瓦伯格的闪光实验<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">20</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">世纪初英国的布莱克曼、德国的瓦伯格用藻类进行闪光实验，在光能量相同的前提下，一种用连续光照（<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟），另一种用闪光照射，中间隔一定暗期（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>秒光照，<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>秒暗，共<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>分钟），发现后者光合作用总产量是连续光下的<SPAN lang=EN-US>200%</SPAN>～<SPAN lang=EN-US>400%</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.15pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.92"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）阿农的实验<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1954</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年美国科学家阿农<SPAN lang=EN-US>(D.I.Arnon)</SPAN>等发现在光下的叶绿体，不供给<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>时，既积累<SPAN lang=EN-US>NADPH</SPAN>也积累<SPAN lang=EN-US>ATP</SPAN>；进一步，撤去光照，供给<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>，发现<SPAN lang=EN-US>NADPH</SPAN>和<SPAN lang=EN-US>ATP</SPAN>被消耗，并有有机物（<SPAN lang=EN-US>CH<SUB>2</SUB>O</SPAN>）产生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">学生小组合作阅读分析资料、汇报交流，并回答之前提出的问题：光合作用释放的氧气来自于水。氧气的产生和葡萄糖的形成是来自于光合作用的两个过程。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">教师用手机录音软件记录学生的交流、播放学生讨论中的疑问。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">例如：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">水的光解具体发生在细胞的哪个部位？水中的氢元素去向如何？</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT face=Calibri>NADPH</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">是什么物质？</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT face=Calibri>NADPH</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">和</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT face=Calibri>ATP</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">如何用于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><FONT face=Calibri>CO<SUB>2</SUB></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">形成有机物？等问题。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">师生共同讨论解决问题，建构光反应</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">概念模型</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0; tab-stops: 54.65pt"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">在此基础上，教师提出新问题：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">葡萄糖等</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">有机物的形成过程是怎样进行的？</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=3>设计意图：明确小组分工，提高每个学生的参与度，发挥小组长的协调和组织作用，提高课堂教学的效率。记录学生讨论过程中的问题，以学生的问题作为新的探究支架，增强学习的兴趣，培养探究能力。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 0cm; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">4.3.2 </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">分析科学史，构建碳反应概念模型<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">教师提供如下科学史资料：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">）美国加州大学贝克利分校的马尔文·卡尔文与他的同事们在<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>世纪<SPAN lang=EN-US>40</SPAN>年代到<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>年代中期<SPAN lang=EN-US>, </SPAN>利用<SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN></SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>标记的<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>研究一种小球藻，以确定该植物在光合作用中如何进行碳反应。经<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>年左右的时间，他终于弄清楚了光合作用中二氧化碳同化的循环式途径，被称为卡尔文循环。为此，他被授予<SPAN lang=EN-US>1961</SPAN>年度的诺贝尔化学奖。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">）卡尔文以小球藻为主要研究对象，利用<SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN></SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>饲喂植物经过不同时间的照光（数秒直至数十分钟）后，迅速将小球藻放进沸酒精中杀死，使酶反应终止，提取产物利用行双向纸层析法技术分离，利用放射自显影法鉴定放射性碳存在于哪些化合物中。在<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>秒光照后，卡尔文找到了<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>3</SUB></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>5</SUB></SPAN>和<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>6</SUB></SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>7</SUB></SPAN>等<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>余种带有<SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN></SUP><SPAN lang=EN-US>C</SPAN>标记的化合物。当把光照时间缩短为<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>秒时， 一种<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>3</SUB>(3-</SPAN>磷酸甘油酸<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>占全部放射性的<SPAN lang=EN-US>90</SPAN>％。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.6pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">）在实验中，卡尔文发现在光照和<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>的供应下一种<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>3 </SUB></SPAN>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3-</SPAN>磷酸甘油酸，<SPAN lang=EN-US>PGA</SPAN>）和<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>5 </SUB></SPAN>（核酮糖二磷酸，<SPAN lang=EN-US>RuBP</SPAN>）很快达到饱和并保持稳定。但当把灯关掉后，保持<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>的供应，<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>3 </SUB></SPAN>的浓度急速升高，同时<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>5 </SUB></SPAN>的浓度急速降低。如果在保持光照下突然中断<SPAN lang=EN-US>CO<SUB>2</SUB></SPAN>的供应，则<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>5 </SUB></SPAN>就积累起来，<SPAN lang=EN-US>C<SUB>3 </SUB></SPAN>就急速降低（图<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 20.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0"><v:shape id=图片_x0020_3 style="HEIGHT: 146.2pt; WIDTH: 316.5pt; MARGIN-TOP: 0.85pt; POSITION: absolute; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 58.2pt; LEFT: 0px; Z-INDEX: -251658752" type="#_x0000_t75" o:spid="_x0000_s1026" wrapcoords="-36 0 -36 21510 21600 21510 21600 0 -36 0"><FONT size=3><v:imagedata o:title="" src="file:///C:/Users/dlian112/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image002.png"></v:imagedata><?xml:namespace prefix = "w" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" /><w:wrap type="tight"></w:wrap></FONT></v:shape><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
